y%20%7C%20Topic%3A%20Deep-sea%20whale%20graveyard%20reveals%20new%20extinct%20species&amp;dest=https%3A//maxmrry.github.io/curious-rabbit-hole-bot/&amp;token=9412ce3ed98e5434694fdbb1057a07ce58d5928e92b5cb466c9677cb0e6bd128' style='text-decoration:none;'&gt;🤔 Hmm. Okay, but forgettable.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href='https://redirect-service-73lh.onrender.com/signal?item=https%3A//www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01886-x&amp;signal=0&amp;source=Nature&amp;type=rss&amp;context=not_interested%20%7C%20Topic%3A%20Deep-sea%20whale%20graveyard%20reveals%20new%20extinct%20species&amp;dest=https%3A//maxmrry.github.io/curious-rabbit-hole-bot/&amp;token=9412ce3ed98e5434694fdbb1057a07ce58d5928e92b5cb466c9677cb0e6bd128' style='text-decoration:none;'&gt;🥱 Don't Care... Not Interested&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href='https://redirect-service-73lh.onrender.com/signal?item=https%3A//www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01886-x&amp;signal=-1&amp;source=Nature&amp;type=rss&amp;context=too_gloomy%20%7C%20Topic%3A%20Deep-sea%20whale%20graveyard%20reveals%20new%20extinct%20species&amp;dest=https%3A//maxmrry.github.io/curious-rabbit-hole-bot/&amp;token=9412ce3ed98e5434694fdbb1057a07ce58d5928e92b5cb466c9677cb0e6bd128' style='text-decoration:none;'&gt;⛔ Too Gloomy / Negative&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">brain:https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01886-x</guid><pubDate>Fri, 12 Jun 2026 10:07:44 +0100</pubDate></item><item><title>(Audio) Sonny Baker: England Test squad, influences, and performance diet</title><link>https://www.listennotes.com/e/da758957841a40578728be7752d59050/</link><description>&lt;b&gt;Source:&lt;/b&gt; The Analyst Inside Cricket&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src='https://cdn-images-3.listennotes.com/podcasts/the-analyst-inside/sonny-baker-enthusiasm-oY1XpiawRm9-M9Zk6E2LcG-.300x300.jpg' alt='thumbnail' style='max-width:100%; border-radius:8px;'/&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This podcast interviews Sonny Baker on his selection for the England Te